            "text": "<h2>*Special Note</h2><p>Jack&rose reserves the right to determine if the product is defective. Please get return authurization from our customer service before returning the item(s), or we cannot process your return request.</p><p>If the return is caused by the consumer, consumer should be responsible for the shipping fee. The specific fee should be based on the express company you choose.</p><p>If due to our reasons, the goods received are damaged or not correct, and the consumer is not required to bear the shipping fee for this reason.</p>"
